OL,3,GNEWSATwo flat blocks evacuated over
OL,4,Astructural problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 200 households have been
OL,7,Fevacuated from two blocks of flats in
OL,8,Feast London due to "serious structural
OL,9,Fissues" in both buildings.
OL,11,FNewham Council said it was providing
OL,12,Femergency accommodation and support to
OL,13,Fresidents from about 210 households
OL,14,Ffrom Centurion Tower and St Vincent
OL,15,FCourt in Canning Town, who were
OL,16,Fevacuated in the early hours of Friday.
OL,18,FThe council said it was informed by the
OL,19,FLondon Fire Brigade on Thursday night
OL,20,Fof serious structural problems in the
OL,21,Fbuildings, which had been reported by
OL,22,Fthe property management company.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
