OL,3,GNEWSATwo flat blocks evacuated over
OL,4,Astructural problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Gray, Newham's deputy mayor and
OL,7,Fcabinet member for housing, said the
OL,8,Fcouncil was on hand to support affected
OL,9,Fresidents.
